# 8. AEGIS WARNING LOG (NEW SYSTEM OUTPUT)

Instead of blocking immediately (hybrid autonomy model):

```ts
interface AEGISWarningLog {
  trace_id: string;
  risk_type: string;
  severity: "low" | "medium" | "high";
  message: string;
  context: any;
  recommended_action: string;
  emitted_to: "event_spine";
}
```

### Behavior:

* LOW → allow + log
* MEDIUM → allow + log + flag
* HIGH → require confirmation OR escalate to ODIN re-route suggestion

---

# 9. HYBRID AUTONOMY RULE (CORE CHANGE)

### OLD MODEL

* strict binary block/allow

### NEW MODEL

* allow execution
* emit structured risk telemetry
* optionally escalate routing suggestion

This enables:

* self-observation
* system debugging
* no execution deadlocks

